WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.540
Picture an old file

2
00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:03.100
at City Hall.

3
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.360
Most housing promises are

4
00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:05.720
made in good faith.

5
00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:06.660
So why do some

6
00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:08.460
slip? For one,

7
00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:08.820
they last

8
00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:09.820
