16
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.000
The paperwork gets

17
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.820
scattered across reports,

18
00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.300
letters, slides,

19
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.110
minutes in different offices.

20
00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:25.780
housing teams are often

21
00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.080
small, with many

22
00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:28.560
projects to track.

23
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:29.480
Here's what can happen.

24
00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:31.400
A 2024 Maryland state

25
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.800
audit reported that at

26
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.640
three state-funded properties,

27
00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:36.060
39 of 56

28
00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:37.080
homes had not

29
00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.140
been used for low-income

30
00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:39.980
