31
00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:40.960
In California,

32
00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:42.080
the city of Calabasas

33
00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:43.780
reported losing 140

34
00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:45.280
affordable homes at

35
00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:46.720
one apartment complex,

36
00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:47.960
after efforts to keep

37
00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:49.140
them affordable did not

38
00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.180
succeed. Neither finding

39
00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:52.200
involves our example,

40
00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.180
but they show

41
00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:54.240
why clear,

42
00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:55.490
